    "algorithm_url": "https://xlinux.nist.gov/dads/HTML/CupifGianniniTreeTraversal.html",
    "pinned_behavior": "DADS pseudocode: enumerate count from zero through 2^height-1, XOR with the supplied key, consume low-order bits from root to leaf."
